<section class="case__body">
  <h2>The <em>backbone.</em></h2>
  <div class="case__body__copy">
    <p>Training's part of my routine. I've worked with a personal trainer for four years and we've built a programme that works — <strong>consistency and tracking</strong> are the whole game. What's always annoyed me is the <strong>tooling</strong>. Every block starts the same way: a PDF plan lands, gets pasted into a Google Doc, columns tidied, dates added, numbers updated session after session. Every few months a new plan arrives and you start over. After four years of that, I <em>built the fix</em>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

